@startuml

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  CloudAI Task Lifecycle — Presentation Sequence Diagram
'  Designed for 16:9 slides · Clean · Large fonts · Minimal clutter
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam roundCorner 8

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1E293B
    ArrowFontSize 20
    ArrowFontColor #1E293B
    LifeLineBorderColor #1E293B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBorderThickness 3
    ParticipantBorderThickness 2
    ParticipantBorderColor #1E3A5F
    ParticipantFontSize 28
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantPadding 40
    DividerBorderColor #64748B
    DividerBorderThickness 2
    DividerFontColor #0F172A
    DividerFontSize 24
    GroupBorderColor #64748B
    GroupHeaderFontSize 20
    GroupFontColor #334155
}

skinparam note {
    BorderColor #94A3B8
    BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    FontSize 18
    FontColor #1E293B
}

title <size:36><b>CloudAI — Task Lifecycle</b></size>\n<size:18><color:#475569>Master Node  ·  PPO Scheduler  ·  Worker Node</color></size>\n

actor "      User      " as U
participant "    Master Node    " as M #B6D4F7
participant "    PPO Service    " as P #D4C8F5
participant "   Worker Node   " as W #A7EDCA

|||

== <b>  Registration & Heartbeat  </b> ==

W -> M : **RegisterWorker**(capacity, specs)
note right of M #D1FAE5 : Worker persisted to MongoDB\nHeartbeats begin (every 5 s)

|||

== <b>  Task Submission  </b> ==

U -> M : **SubmitTask**(image, cmd, resources, SLA)
note right of M #FDEAAB : DB: TASK created · status = queued

|||

== <b>  Scheduling & Assignment  </b> ==

activate M #B6D4F7
M -> P : **SelectWorker**(task, candidates)
P --> M : worker_id
note right of P #D4C8F5 : PPO neural network inference\nFallback → RTS / Round-Robin
M -> W : **AssignTask**(task, attempt_id)
W --> M : Ack ✓
deactivate M

|||

== <b>  Docker Execution  </b> ==

activate W #A7EDCA
W -> W : Pull → Create → Run container
W -> W : Wait for exit · Collect outputs
deactivate W

|||

== <b>  Result & Feedback  </b> ==

W -> M : **ReportCompletion**(status, logs, files)
note right of M #FDEAAB : DB: Finalize ATTEMPT + RESULT\nRelease resources
M --> U : Result + logs + output files
M -> P : **ReportOutcome**(reward, SLA_met)
P -> P : PPO gradient update
note right of P #D4C8F5 : Checkpoint persisted\nto MongoDB GridFS

|||

== <b>  Recovery  </b> ==

note over M, W #E2E8F0
  **Timeout** (>30 s no heartbeat) → mark worker inactive → requeue task
  **Cancel** → CancelTask RPC → stop container → update status
end note

|||

@enduml
